{"id":"en_phoenix-rising-she-s-back-to-tame-the-villain","title":"Phoenix Rising: She's Back to Tame the Villain","titleEn":"Phoenix Rising: She's Back to Tame the Villain","description":"Talia gave her life for a family that never cared, only to awaken as the villainess of a novel, destined for ruin. Rather than plead for love again, she walks away from both her relatives and her betrothed. Taking the lead in Tears of the Nightingale, she becomes a celebrated star, with Eric Barker, a billionaire heir, supporting her. Emma's flawless image begins to crumble as Talia rebuilds her reputation, her profession, and her independence. Yet her foes have one last scheme in store, leaving her to decide whether she can alter her destiny and finally earn the affection she has always been denied. Dramzio is where viewers can follow this series.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/phoenix-rising-shes-back-to-tame-the-villain/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/phoenix-rising-shes-back-to-tame-the-villain/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Contemporary","Rebirth","Revenge","Secret Billionaire/Prince","Female"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d51he/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_phoenix-rising-she-s-back-to-tame-the-villain_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d51he/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_phoenix-rising-she-s-back-to-tame-the-villain_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d51he/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_phoenix-rising-she-s-back-to-tame-the-villain_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{